egories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"NHdE_ObFj7OjQBB3jjqBNQ","review_id":"CbEqb768hcMTy40uGJ7uwg","date":"2018-11-19T14:21:44","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9446746110916138,"text_excerpt":"We came in on Sunday at noon (with a reservation) as a group of 8 out of towners. We picked this place for the brunch reviews and the all you can drink vodka bar they offer for brunch. $20 for the bottomless vodka drinks. They bring you out the vodka and ice in glasses whenever you request them and then you head over to the self serve bar to make whatever concoction you can think of. A couple in our group didn't want the bottomless but did order bloody Mary's and they were very good, perfect amount of spice and had pickled zesty green beans and cocktail olives. We started with the hot garlic shrimp boil and fried pickles, both very good but I especially loved the shrimp boil. Huge shrimp ..."},{"business_id":"NHdE_ObFj7OjQBB3jjqBNQ","review_id":"Q7bjkQb5vTpSvc4gLTCg-w","date":"2017-06-10T16:30:19","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9432885050773621,"text_excerpt":"First time stopping in here for brunch, the food was amazing and the service was just as good. I really can't think of a better place to be for an 11 o'clock Saturday brunch. They even to distill their own vodka in house which is pretty amazing! Highly recommend this place"},{"business_id":"NHdE_ObFj7OjQBB3jjqBNQ","review_id":"MQJJcVMfuI5wQ2mGJc6XxQ","date":"2018-04-10T00:45:02","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9411104917526245,"text_excerpt":"Delicious southern inspired food. We went for brunch with the bottomless vodka bar. The food was amazing, but the vodka for the bar took a while to get (we had to order the next round when we were halfway through our drinks). We started with the avocado crab dip and it was so good, a great way to start our meals. I had the catfish sandwich, my husband had the fried chicken and biscuits and our friends had both the fried chicken sandwich and the French toast. Everyone was over the moon happy with their food! We left feeling so satisfied and raving about our brunch (although a food coma followed). Really fun ambience where you can see straight into the distillery. The dining rooms were mode..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"NHdE_ObFj7OjQBB3jjqBNQ","photo_id":"8xYANYWRDToDVRfz-KUYGQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/8xYANYWRDToDVRfz-KUYGQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8665930032730103},{"business_id":"NHdE_ObFj7OjQBB3jjqBNQ","photo_id":"oB8pQzYSLcz0KLxAUrM3wg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/oB8pQzYSLcz0KLxAUrM3wg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8641544580459595},{"business_id":"NHdE_ObFj7OjQBB3jjqBNQ","photo_id":"dv21O7VOfnErPVtCgKWyBA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/dv21O7VOfnErPVtCgKWyBA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8484138250350952},{"business_id":"NHdE_ObFj7OjQBB3jjqBNQ","photo_id":"4YM9Z9d4fK2s_YGKq_4xfw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/4YM9Z9d4fK2s_YGKq_4xfw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8465330600738525},{"business_id":"NHdE_ObFj7OjQBB3jjqBNQ","photo